Today is Saturday.
My morning work at the cafe is finished.
I step outside.
It is raining heavily outside.
It is the monsoon season in Kochi now.
It has been raining here for three weeks.
I have an umbrella in my bag.
But an umbrella alone is not enough to ride the bicycle.
I want a new raincoat.
I also need to buy a new shirt along with it.
There is a good clothing store in town.
That store is very big.
I decide to go there.
